// ADR 0043 §5a: a capability that started life inside checkout-app and
// moved here when a second application, checkout-clientvertical, needed it
// (ADR 0071 §3). Each caller added `use checkout.core.LedgerApi`; no call
// site changed.
// ADR 0060: one line per entry over a plain connection to the ledger.
capability LedgerApi {
    gateway record(entry: string) -> Result<None, string> requires Socket {
        return match (Socket.connect("ledger.internal", 7000)) {
            Ok(connection) -> {
                sent = Socket.write(connection, "${entry}\n".utf8());
                Socket.close(connection);
                return match (sent) {
                    Ok(_) -> Ok(None),
                    Err(_) -> Err("ledger write failed")
                }
            },

            Err(_) -> Err("ledger unreachable")
        }
    }
}
